-Really?
-Yeah.

510
00:26:24,520 --> 00:26:26,240
我订了辆新款奥迪A3，
算是辆实用又小巧的好车。
I've got the new Audi A3
on order, which is a good
little practical car.

511
00:26:26,280 --> 00:26:28,480
那可是辆掀背车！
你买两厢掀背车干嘛啊？
That's a hatchback!
What'd you bought
a hatchback for?

512
00:26:28,520 --> 00:26:30,080
我倒车入库技术不太行，
I'm not very good at parking,

513
00:26:30,120 --> 00:26:32,640
所以得要个小巧点的，
能顺顺当当地插进去。
so I need
something quite small
that I can slip in nicely.

514
00:26:32,680 --> 00:26:35,720
-我敢打赌你肯定想，亲爱的！
-[观众大笑]
-I bet you do, love!
-[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

515
00:26:38,160 --> 00:26:40,320
我很期待BBC一台明晚六点的节目。
I'm looking forward
to BBC One, 6:00.

516
00:26:40,360 --> 00:26:41,920
-而且还是直播，对吧？
-没错。
-Live as well, isn't it?
-Yeah.

517
00:26:41,960 --> 00:26:44,800
不是，我很期待我的新车啊。
你为什么不喜欢它们？
No, I'm excited
about my new car.
Why don't you like them?

518
00:26:44,840 --> 00:26:46,240
-你有什么……
-A3？
-What have you...
-A3s?

519
00:26:46,280 --> 00:26:48,120
它们……淡得跟白开水一样。
They... It's like water.

520
00:26:48,160 --> 00:26:49,800
但人家有运动版啊。
出了个R版之类的。
But they do a sporty version.
They do an R version
or something.

521
00:26:49,840 --> 00:26:51,760
那当然了。
不过想必你买的
不是R版吧？
Well, of course they do.
But you're not having
the R version presumably?

522
00:26:51,800 --> 00:26:53,960
-我还真买了。
-哦，你居然买了
R版！
-I am, yes.
-Oh, you're having
the R version!

523
00:26:54,000 --> 00:26:55,920
就是这姑娘，当年送我的
生日礼物居然是……
This is the girl who got me
for a birthday present...

524
00:26:55,960 --> 00:26:57,840
我确实送了。
而且之后我就再没见过。
I did actually.
And I've never seen them.

525
00:26:57,880 --> 00:26:59,320
没有，我装车上了，
但我把车给卖了。
No, I put them on the car,
but I sold the car.

526
00:26:59,360 --> 00:27:01,360
什么？什么东西？到底送了啥？
What? What? What are they?

527
00:27:01,400 --> 00:27:04,320
-我送你的是离开《大早餐》
节目的告别礼物……
-轮毂！
-I bought you as a Big
Breakfastleaving present...
-Alloys!

528
00:27:04,360 --> 00:27:06,640
-典型埃塞克斯妹子
会送人的玩意儿！
-才不是。
-What an Essex girl
gets someone!
-No.

529
00:27:06,680 --> 00:27:07,880
她送了我一套AMG轮毂
She bought me AMG alloys

530
00:27:07,920 --> 00:27:11,000
因为CLK320刚上市时
我就买了一辆。
'cause I bought a CLK320
when it first came out.

531
00:27:11,040 --> 00:27:13,240
丹妮丝非常贴心地
给它买了套AMG轮圈。
But Denise very kindly
bought the AMG wheels for it.

532
00:27:13,280 --> 00:27:15,000
-结果扭头他就把车卖了！
-才没有。
-And then he sold the car!
-No, I didn't.

533
00:27:15,040 --> 00:27:17,200
-我卖车之前
把AMG轮圈拆下来了。
-好吧。
-I took the AMG wheels off
before I sold the car.
-Right.

534
00:27:17,240 --> 00:27:19,680
搞笑的是，我刚在eBay上
把它卖了580英镑。
Funnily enough, I've just got
£580 for them on eBay.

535
00:27:19,720 --> 00:27:21,720
[观众笑声]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

536
00:27:21,760 --> 00:27:24,280
说真的，没错。
我这可都是为了你。
Seriously, yeah.
I'm doing it for you.

537
00:27:25,080 --> 00:27:26,080
你们的圈速……
Your laps...

538
00:27:26,120 --> 00:27:27,360
你说什么？
I beg your pardon?

539
00:27:27,400 --> 00:27:28,800
先别提这个，杰里米。
Not now, Jeremy.

540
00:27:28,840 --> 00:27:31,960
# 全体跟着跳起来！ #
# Everybody dance now! #

541
00:27:32,000 --> 00:27:34,920
-行了行了。
-大家想不想看一段
我们拍到的……
-That's enough.
-Would you like to see
a little shot we've got of...

542
00:27:34,960 --> 00:27:37,760
-这两位练习时的画面……
-总不可能是史上最慢吧。
-Of these two having
a bit of a practice...
-It can't be the slowest ever.

543
00:27:37,800 --> 00:27:39,400
正式圈速我先不给大家看，
I'm not going
to show you the lap,

544
00:27:39,440 --> 00:27:41,400
我只给在座的女士们先生们
瞧瞧一段练习片段。
I'm just gonna show
the ladies and gentlemen
a bit of a practice.

545
00:27:41,440 --> 00:27:43,440
他开得特别棒。
说实话，我都惊艳到了。
He did it really well.
I was really
impressed, actually.

546
00:27:43,480 --> 00:27:44,920
-特别棒？
-对啊，他真开得挺好。
-Really well?
-Yeah, he was really good.

547
00:27:44,960 --> 00:27:46,600
-按埃塞克斯的标准来看？
-没错。
-This is by Essex standards?
-Yes.

548
00:27:46,640 --> 00:27:48,200
行，那我们就来看看
Okay, let's have a look at

549
00:27:48,240 --> 00:27:51,080
约翰尼所谓“特别棒”的
车技到底如何。
some of Johnny's
"really well" driving.

550
00:27:51,120 --> 00:27:53,640
走起……
Here we go...

551
00:27:53,680 --> 00:27:55,560
噢，来到那个谁来谁滑出去的
魔鬼弯道了。
Oh, it's coming down
to that very difficult corner
where everybody goes off.

552
00:27:55,600 --> 00:27:56,880
[轮胎尖叫声]
[TYRES SCREECHING]

553
00:27:59,240 --> 00:28:00,800
我的天哪！
Oh, my word!

554
00:28:00,840 --> 00:28:02,600
[观众笑声]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

555
00:28:03,000 --> 00:28:04,200
漂亮！
Yes!

556
00:28:06,800 --> 00:28:08,880
-刚才那下吓着你了吧，嗯？
-才没有。
-That frightened you, there,
didn't it?
-No, it didn't.

557
00:28:08,920 --> 00:28:10,680
-明明就吓尿了。
-真不敢相信。
-It did.
-Can't believe it.

558
00:28:12,480 --> 00:28:14,360
这就是所谓的“开得真棒”，是吧？
That was really good, was it?

559
00:28:14,400 --> 00:28:16,640
那是因为他们叫我给观众
表演一下轮胎打滑。
Because they asked me
to give it a bit of wheel spin
for the crowd.

560
00:28:16,680 --> 00:28:18,400
他们说我开得太稳、太无聊了。
They said it was
too boringly brilliant.

561
00:28:18,440 --> 00:28:21,320
你知道吗，其实……
那之后我还真摸了摸约翰尼的心跳。
Do you know, I actually...
I did feel Johnny's heart
after that.

562
00:28:21,360 --> 00:28:23,680
-跳得那叫一个快。
-你知道最让人暗爽的是什么吗？
-It was going so fast.
-Do you know
what's really lovely?

563
00:28:23,720 --> 00:28:25,720
就是像那样撞车，
穿过去……
It's crashing like that,
going through...

564
00:28:25,760 --> 00:28:27,840
你知道撞车时那种感觉吧？糟透了。
整个人心都凉到谷底。
You know that feeling you get
when you crash? It's awful.
It's a place you go to.

565
00:28:27,880 --> 00:28:30,800
能在这么一个毫无顾忌的环境里撞车，
感觉真是太美妙了。
It was so nice
to be able to do it
in a carefree environment.

566
00:28:30,840 --> 00:28:33,280
你真该把这整片地方
改名叫“单身汉乐园”。
You should rename
this whole area "Stag World".

567
00:28:33,320 --> 00:28:34,320
[观众笑声]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

568
00:28:34,360 --> 00:28:36,640
专门给大老爷们儿放飞自我。
Just for men to roam free.

569
00:28:36,680 --> 00:28:38,880
你来这儿尽情撞车，
然后在这边，
You come here
and just crash cars,
and in here,

570
00:28:38,920 --> 00:28:41,600
立满钢管，
上面全是上下翻飞的跳舞女郎。
all these poles will have
ladies going up and down.

571
00:28:41,640 --> 00:28:43,040
这太棒了。
有人吐得七荤八素，
This is marvellous.
People being sick

572
00:28:43,080 --> 00:28:45,680
还有人在你开车时
朝你疯狂打彩弹。
and other guys paintballing
while you drive.

573
00:28:45,720 --> 00:28:48,680
这就是“大猩猩单身汉乐园”！
开全国连锁！
This is "Clarky's Stag World!"
A franchise!

574
00:28:48,720 --> 00:28:51,800
而且这绝对是当爹的
真正他妈乐在其中的家庭日。
And it's actually a family day
out the dads will actually
bloody enjoy.

575
00:28:51,840 --> 00:28:53,320
[观众笑声]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

576
00:28:53,360 --> 00:28:55,840
因为每次我看到广告上写“合家欢出游”，
'Cause whenever I see ads
saying "family day out",

577
00:28:55,880 --> 00:29:00,800
总有个可怜的……
没错，根本笑不出来的倒霉爹。
there's one poor...
Yeah, who's not enjoying it.

578
00:29:00,840 --> 00:29:03,680
-话说回来，他跑得怎么样？
我是说……
-我们马上就能看到了。
-So, how did he do, anyway?
I mean...
-We're going to see it.

579
00:29:03,720 --> 00:29:05,640
他笑得有点冷嘲热讽。
我觉得咱们成绩肯定好不到哪儿去。
He's slightly mocking.
I don't think
we did that well.

580
00:29:05,680 --> 00:29:07,320
好吧，马上揭晓。
Well, we're gonna find out.

581
00:29:07,360 --> 00:29:10,720
因为原地打转之后，
我们可就掏出秒表了。
Because after
the spin, we then
got the stopwatch out.

582
00:29:10,760 --> 00:29:12,600
-没错。
-那么，请看大屏幕。
-Right.
-And, uh, here we go.

583
00:29:13,240 --> 00:29:14,280
[引擎轰鸣声]
[ENGINE REVVING]

584
00:29:14,320 --> 00:29:15,400
准备好了喊我。
Tell me.

585
00:29:15,440 --> 00:29:17,120
-[轮胎尖叫声]
-走！
-[TYRES SQUEAL]
-Go!

586
00:29:20,480 --> 00:29:22,000
我闻到糊味了。
你闻到了吗？
I smell burning.
Do you get that?

587
00:29:22,040 --> 00:29:23,720
-[观众笑声]
-你懂我的意思吧？
-[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]
-Do you get me?

588
00:29:23,760 --> 00:29:25,320
[轮胎持续尖叫]
[TYRES SQUEALING]

589
00:29:25,360 --> 00:29:26,600
克拉克森：这走线完全错了。
CLARKSON: It's completely
the wrong line.

590
00:29:26,640 --> 00:29:28,680
才没走错，
她开得简直完美。
It's not the wrong line,
she was perfect.

591
00:29:28,720 --> 00:29:31,000
[观众笑声]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

592
00:29:31,040 --> 00:29:32,800
-你真的为我自豪吗？
-为你骄傲。
-Are you really proud?
-Proud of you.

593
00:29:32,840 --> 00:29:34,920
哈，埃塞克斯辣妹为车里的纯爷们儿自豪！
Well, Essex girl is proud
of man in car!

594
00:29:34,960 --> 00:29:38,080
这是我这辈子经历过
最男人味爆棚的时刻！
That's the most manly thing
that has happened to me
ever in life!

595
00:29:38,120 --> 00:29:40,080
[轮胎持续尖叫]
[TYRES SQUEALING]

596
00:29:40,120 --> 00:29:42,480
-克拉克森：哦，我的天……
-来吧，这才是真正的测车！
-CLARKSON: Oh, my...
-Come on, that's how
you test a vehicle!

597
00:29:42,520 --> 00:29:44,120
[观众笑声]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

598
00:29:44,160 --> 00:29:46,680
给你个忠告：
进弯前先把挡给换了。
Here's a tip.
Change gear before
you get to a corner.

599
00:29:47,400 --> 00:29:48,680
沃恩：准备好了吗？
VAUGHAN: Ready?

600
00:29:49,320 --> 00:29:50,760
漂亮。刹停了。
Beautiful. Stopped.

601
00:29:50,800 --> 00:29:51,920
-[齿轮打齿声]
-瞧瞧这档换的！
-[GRINDING SOUND]
-There's the gear change!

602
00:29:51,960 --> 00:29:53,280
[观众大笑]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

603
00:29:54,520 --> 00:29:55,920
谢谢各位！
Thank you!

604
00:29:55,960 --> 00:29:57,840
这感觉就像在埃塞克斯
通宵鬼混一样。
This is like a night out
in Essex.

605
00:29:57,880 --> 00:30:01,600
亲爱的，你可以带我
在埃塞克斯的乡间小道上兜兜风。
You could take me
for a drive round Essex's
country roads, love.

606
00:30:01,640 --> 00:30:03,640
对啊，“宝贝儿，
我带你去好好兜上一圈。”
Yeah, "I'll take you
for a lovey drive, love."

607
00:30:03,680 --> 00:30:07,560
这要是换成周日下午，
你开车载我出去
兜兜风，
If this was a Sunday afternoon
and you were taking me for
a little spin in your car,

608
00:30:07,600 --> 00:30:10,600
-回家后我肯定就从了你。
-真的假的？
-I'd definitely go home
and put out.
-Would you?

609
00:30:10,640 --> 00:30:12,200
[观众大笑]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

610
00:30:12,240 --> 00:30:14,240
克拉克森：就这烂车技
你都愿意跟他睡？
CLARKSON: You'd put out
for that sort of driving?

611
00:30:14,280 --> 00:30:15,880
你过弯怎么就不知道
用足赛道宽度呢？
Why don't you
use all the road?

612
00:30:15,920 --> 00:30:17,560
兜完风要是再带我去
If I could follow this up
with, like, two hours

613
00:30:17,600 --> 00:30:19,680
塞恩斯伯里超市的停车场
漂移原地画圈甩尾两小时。
of doughnutting
in a Sainsbury car park.

614
00:30:20,520 --> 00:30:21,960
[轮胎尖叫声]
[TYRES SQUEALING]

615
00:30:22,480 --> 00:30:24,120
[丹妮丝大笑]
[DENISE LAUGHING]

616
00:30:24,160 --> 00:30:26,720
观众：哦！
AUDIENCE: Oh!

617
00:30:26,760 --> 00:30:29,120
到最后一个弯道
突然睡醒了！
Suddenly we wake up
for the last corner!

618
00:30:29,160 --> 00:30:30,440
[掌声]
[APPLAUSE]

619
00:30:30,480 --> 00:30:32,000
这才叫开车！
That's how you do that!

620
00:30:32,040 --> 00:30:35,200
就该这么开！
懂了吧！
That is how you do that!
You know it!

621
00:30:37,120 --> 00:30:39,400
-你懂的。
-其实我觉得你开得
真心挺棒的。
-You know it.
-I thought you did
a really good job, actually.

622
00:30:39,440 --> 00:30:41,360
确实很棒，
完成得很漂亮。
I thought it was a good job.
Good job well done.

623
00:30:41,400 --> 00:30:43,520
因为别人都练了那么久，
我这可是第一圈。
'Cause they all
had lots of practise.
That was my first time round.

624
00:30:43,560 --> 00:30:45,160
得了吧，
你这纯属扯淡！
No, you see,
that's just not true!

625
00:30:45,200 --> 00:30:47,720
我们可都看到了，
你跑第一圈的时候，
车尾朝前倒着冲出去了！
'Cause we saw you
first time around, ended up
going backwards!

626
00:30:47,760 --> 00:30:49,840
好吧，这谎撒得一眼就穿帮了。
干得漂亮，杰里米。
Actually, it was a lie
easily discovered.
Well done, Jeremy.

627
00:30:49,880 --> 00:30:51,760
你觉得你能排在
板子上的什么位置？
Where do you think
you've come on there?

628
00:30:51,800 --> 00:30:53,920
我大概……不知道啊，
我觉得应该不算快。
I've probably...
I don't know.
I don't think it's that fast.

629
00:30:53,960 --> 00:30:56,160
-比乔丹快吧。
-我觉得大概，没准……
-Above Jordan.
-I'd say probably, maybe...

630
00:30:56,200 --> 00:30:58,080
希望能刚好排在
恩菲尔德上面。
Hope to have made
just above Enfield.

631
00:30:58,120 --> 00:30:59,760
大概在恩菲尔德
和维加斯之间吧。
Between Enfield
and Vegas maybe.

632
00:30:59,800 --> 00:31:02,080
不不不！
你可比他们快多了！
No, no, no!
You're way faster than that!

633
00:31:02,120 --> 00:31:05,240
-丹妮丝，你自己怎么看？
-在戈登和沃德曼之间吧。
-What do you think, Denise?
-Between Gordon and Vorderman.

634
00:31:05,280 --> 00:31:08,760
-戈登和……我找找在哪，
哦，戈登和沃德曼！
-对。
-Gordon and where are we now.
Oh, Gordon and Vorderman!
-Yeah.

635
00:31:08,800 --> 00:31:10,400
胃口可真不小。
Now, that's ambitious.

636
00:31:10,440 --> 00:31:12,440
-很大吗？
-[观众大笑]
-Is it?
-[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

637
00:31:12,480 --> 00:31:14,560
-1分……
-怎样？
-One minute...
-Yeah?

638
00:31:15,080 --> 00:31:16,200
……50……
...fifty...

639
00:31:17,280 --> 00:31:19,640
……3秒4。
...three point four.

640
00:31:19,680 --> 00:31:21,800
说实在的，这成绩烂透了！
Which frankly is dreadful!

641
00:31:21,840 --> 00:31:23,720
-没那么差吧！
-简直烂透了！
-It's not that bad!
-It's dreadful!

642
00:31:23,760 --> 00:31:26,000
我是说，你当时可没这么数落维尼·琼斯，
他才跑了1分53秒。
I mean, you didn't say that
to Vinnie Jones. He got 1.53.

643
00:31:26,040 --> 00:31:27,960
-其实我自己也挺意外的。
-克拉克森：
少跟我犟。
-I'm surprised actually.
-CLARKSON:
Don't argue with me.

644
00:31:28,000 --> 00:31:30,360
-我本来以为要快得多。
-我以为怎么着
也该比这快得多呢。
-I thought it was much faster.
-I thought it would be
much quicker than that.

645
00:31:30,400 --> 00:31:32,480
说句公道话，我得为自己辩解两句，
