你却缩在一个巴掌大的座舱里。[轻笑]
you're sitting
in a tiny cabin. [CHUCKLES]

1032
00:54:34,940 --> 00:54:38,540
油耗高得吓死人，但它有种……
整台车完全属于你的感觉。
You're using an immense amount
of fuel, but it's sort of...
It's all yours.

1033
00:54:38,580 --> 00:54:42,020
我来告诉你们……要是买了911，
我最担心的会是什么：
Now I'll tell you the...
The worry for me would be,
if you bought the 911,

1034
00:54:42,060 --> 00:54:45,140
总有那么一天，你在乡间小路上
正尽情享受那极致的驾驶乐趣，
at some point you are
going to be on a country road
enjoying that brilliant drive,

1035
00:54:45,180 --> 00:54:48,660
瞄了一眼后视镜，瞥见后面跟了
一辆那样的捷豹，心里就会想：
you're going to look in your
mirror and you're gonna see
one of those Jags and think,

1036
00:54:48,700 --> 00:54:51,260
[叹气]“唉，我当初要是买那辆就好了。”
[GROANS] "Oh, I should have
gone for that one."

1037
00:54:51,300 --> 00:54:53,020
我跟你们讲个有意思的事。
I'll tell you what I think
is interesting here.

1038
00:54:53,060 --> 00:54:56,380
咱们压根提都没提那辆宝马。
We haven't discussed the BMW.

1039
00:54:56,420 --> 00:54:58,780
-哈蒙德：因为太无聊了呗。
-其实它就像慕尼黑一样。
-HAMMOND: Well, it's boring.
-It's like Munich, actually.

1040
00:54:58,820 --> 00:55:01,180
-[笑]
-但事实就是这样。你想想，
去慕尼黑这种地方，
-[LAUGHS]
-But it is. If you think
about it, you go to Munich,

1041
00:55:01,220 --> 00:55:03,420
住的是顶级的豪华酒店，
四周风景美不胜收，
you get a fantastic hotel,
the place looks great,

1042
00:55:03,460 --> 00:55:06,020
干净整洁，
服务周到，
饭菜可口，无可挑剔。
it's clean and tidy,
the services are good,
food's great. The lot of it.

1043
00:55:06,060 --> 00:55:08,220
可你回到家之后，
绝不会念叨一句：
You come home
and you never think,

1044
00:55:08,260 --> 00:55:09,940
“真希望我还在慕尼黑。”
"Wish I was still in Munich."

1045
00:55:09,980 --> 00:55:12,340
-它只会让你觉得索然无味。
-完全没有灵魂。
-It just leaves you
feeling completely cold.
-There's no magic in it.

1046
00:55:12,380 --> 00:55:14,020
-太无聊了。
-彻底的无聊透顶。
-It's boring.
-Completely boring.

1047
00:55:14,060 --> 00:55:16,780
-所以它出局了。
你要捷豹。
-我要捷豹。
-So that's gone.
You'd have the Jag.
-I'd have the Jag.

1048
00:55:16,820 --> 00:55:18,660
-对。911。
-而你要911。
-Yes. 911.
-And you'd have the 911.

1049
00:55:18,700 --> 00:55:20,620
那么来吧，决定胜负的一票。
So go on. Casting vote.

1050
00:55:20,660 --> 00:55:23,060
-来吧，你真得掏钱买一辆。
-说实话，我真拿不准……
-Go on, you got to
spend money on one.
-I don't know, honestly...

1051
00:55:23,100 --> 00:55:26,100
-理智告诉我
应该买保时捷。
-确实如此。
-Logic dictates
I buy the Porsche.
-It does.

1052
00:55:26,140 --> 00:55:28,780
-但我不会买。
-你选捷豹？
-But I wouldn't.
-You'd go for the Jag?

1053
00:55:28,820 --> 00:55:30,820
我想……我刚拿定主意了。
我要买捷豹。
I think... I've just
made my mind up.
I'd have the Jag.

1054
00:55:30,860 --> 00:55:34,420
-我完全懂你为什么选它。
真的懂，但是……
-它太迷人了。
-I can totally see why.
I really can, but...
-It is magnificent.

1055
00:55:34,460 --> 00:55:36,860
-少数服从多数。
-是的。
-It's a majority verdict.
-Yeah.

1056
00:55:36,900 --> 00:55:38,580
胜出的是捷豹。
And it's the Jag.

1057
00:55:44,300 --> 00:55:45,980
我真希望它空间能大点。
I wish it had more space.

1058
00:55:46,020 --> 00:55:48,260
我真希望它配个限滑差速器。
I wish it had a limited
slip differential.

1059
00:55:48,300 --> 00:55:50,980
我真希望那些按键别那么反人类。
I wish all the buttons
made sense.

1060
00:55:53,660 --> 00:55:58,340
但你永远、永远也不会厌倦
它从80、90英里，
But you would never tire,
ever, of the way it goes
from 80, 90,

1061
00:55:58,380 --> 00:56:01,980
一路狂飙到100、110……
100, 110...

1062
00:56:02,020 --> 00:56:04,860
那种感觉就像是你先造了个硕大无朋的机械增压器，
It's just like you've got
this huge supercharger

1063
00:56:04,900 --> 00:56:09,020
然后像事后临时补上一笔似的，
在屁股后面硬塞了台小V8。
with a small V8 shoved
on the back as a sort of
afterthought.

1064
00:56:09,060 --> 00:56:13,340
开这种车，真正图的不就是这个吗？
刺激！
That's what it's all about,
really, with cars like this.
Excitement!

1065
00:56:13,380 --> 00:56:17,300
而捷豹带给你的刺激，
简直是管饱管够。
And it's excitement
that the Jag delivers,
in spades.

1066
00:56:20,420 --> 00:56:21,980
[掌声]
[APPLAUSE]

1067
00:56:22,940 --> 00:56:24,860
真是一台好车。
It's a great car.

1068
00:56:25,980 --> 00:56:27,380
它和保时捷都是。
That and the Porsche.

1069
00:56:28,460 --> 00:56:30,460
呃……
Um...

1070
00:56:30,500 --> 00:56:33,460
如果可以的话，我想在此刻插一句，
I would just like to say,
if I may, at this point,

1071
00:56:33,500 --> 00:56:36,260
那台宝马今天早上送到这儿了，
斯提格开着它跑了一圈。
that the BMW arrived here
this morning, and The Stig
took it out.

1072
00:56:36,300 --> 00:56:38,820
刷出了一个极快的圈速，
1分28秒几。
It set a blistering time.
One minute 28 point something.

1073
00:56:38,860 --> 00:56:42,020
所以至少在赛道上，
这家伙确实非常、非常快。
So, on the track, at least,
it is very, very fast, this.

1074
00:56:42,060 --> 00:56:45,500
但它开起来依然冷冰冰、毫无生气。
But it is still kind of
cold and clinical.

1075
00:56:45,540 --> 00:56:48,260
而且浑身都是毛病。
座椅奇硬无比，极其难受。
And it is riddled with faults.
The seats are
very uncomfortable.

1076
00:56:48,300 --> 00:56:51,780
坐姿烂透了。
卫星导航根本是个废物。
The driving position's
rubbish. The satellite
navigation's useless.

1077
00:56:51,820 --> 00:56:54,900
要是你选了手动挡，
那离合器简直能把人逼疯。
If you go for a manual
gear box, the clutch is
completely unmanageable.

1078
00:56:54,940 --> 00:56:56,700
比Z4上的还要糟糕。
Even worse than
it is in the Z4.

1079
00:56:56,740 --> 00:56:58,820
行驶品质更是烂得一塌糊涂。
The ride is appalling.

1080
00:56:58,860 --> 00:57:05,100
而且我想我明白
为什么它比捷豹和保时捷
便宜了整整6000英镑。
And I think I know why
it costs £6,000 less than
the Jaguar and Porsche.

1081
00:57:05,140 --> 00:57:08,380
要知道，5系的设计师
是在把车设计完之后去世的。
You know, the designer
of the 5 Series died
after he'd finished it.

1082
00:57:08,420 --> 00:57:11,540
-确实。
-而这辆的设计师，
是画到一半就咽气了。
-He did.
-This one died
while he was doing it.

1083
00:57:11,580 --> 00:57:13,940
这车才设计了一半。
瞧，我指给你看。
Only half of it's styled.
Look, I'll show you.

1084
00:57:13,980 --> 00:57:16,860
他顺着这儿切了一条线，
简直完美，
一条笔挺漂亮的直线。
He's cut it along here.
Perfectly well.
Nice straight line.

1085
00:57:16,900 --> 00:57:20,100
画到这儿就彻底失去了
活下去的希望。你看！
[无力的呻吟]
Got to here and lost the will
to live. Look!
[SLOW GROANING]

1086
00:57:20,140 --> 00:57:24,300
然后换了个人过来，
就这么随手在后头
拍了床大厚被子。
And then someone else came
along and just sort of plonked
a big duvet on the back.

1087
00:57:24,340 --> 00:57:27,060
不过起码它没把我们
这一天的心情给毁了。
But at least it didn't
manage to spoil our day.

1088
00:57:27,100 --> 00:57:29,860
因为当初你说
咱们要一路开去那个海滩，
Because when you said
we were going to drive
all the way up to that beach

1089
00:57:29,900 --> 00:57:33,060
开到威尔士的尽头，
那可是足足有五千英里远……
at the end of Wales,
which is 5,000 miles away...

1090
00:57:33,100 --> 00:57:35,420
可不是嘛，去趟内华达都比去那儿方便。
Yeah, Nevada would have been
more convenient.

1091
00:57:35,460 --> 00:57:37,460
起初我还以为你疯了。
但等咱们到了那儿，
I thought you
were mad at first.
But when we got there,

1092
00:57:37,500 --> 00:57:41,340
-那地方简直绝了，这一天太痛快了！
-确实玩得爽翻了。
-what a place and what a day!
-It was such a lot of fun.

1093
